kld moved to vmxplore on 2026-09-30.

The terminal console that lived here is now `vmx`, built from
github.com/kldload/vmxplore ./cmd/vmx (and its job runner is `vmxctl`).
build-iso.sh no longer builds this directory; the image ships vmx and
links `kld` to it as an alias for one release.

This copy is kept only because tests/smoke-console.sh falls back to its
VNC wire-client test when no vmxplore checkout is named (VMXPLORE_SRC),
and tools/gen-manual-html.py still reads docs/kld.1. Remove it once both
read from vmxplore. Do not fix bugs here: fix them in vmxplore.
